  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Differentiating the given integral with respect to <math><mi>‘</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>’</mi><mo>,</mo></math> we get,<br />&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mi>f</mi><mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>⋅</mo><msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced></mrow> </math> or <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>6</mn> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo><msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br />On integrating, we get,<br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∫</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>6</mn> </mfrac> <mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow> </math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math><br />As <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi></math>",
